          "source_ids": [
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "While you were here, the psychiatry team came to see you. They started you on an antidepressant called sertraline on 20/05. The team also gave you information about depression and how it can affect you. Together with you, they made a safety plan to help you feel more supported."
